  - "physics-informed machine learning"
abstract: >-
  BioLaserTwin is an open-source Python package for forward simulation,
  spatial-spectral feature extraction, identifiability analysis, and
  inverse parameter estimation in biophotonic Fabry-Perot microlasers
  coupled to macromolecular aggregation kinetics.
